      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>If you copy battlefield Experience and KNYFE uses the power, KNYFE&#39;s card resolves and leaves play at which point the text leaves Guise&#39;s card, as that text is no longer on an ongoing card in Guise&#39;s play area.</p><p>If Guise uses it he will destroy the card that the text is on; Uh, Yeah, I&#39;m that Guy.</p><p>If you borrow an Equipment card that destroys itself on a power use KNYFE can&#39;t use that power, as the card is no longer in her play area. &nbsp;If Guise uses that power the equipment card will be destroyed, and Lemme see that stays in play uselessly until it is destroyed.</p>",
